    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/fb413a0b5089bbd3472badd1857813a0.poster.avif?t=1752876180\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/fb413a0b5089bbd3472badd1857813a0.webm?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/fb413a0b5089bbd3472badd1857813a0.mp4?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEAL LIMBS. SWAP POWERS. BREAK THE GALAXY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to SWAPMEAT: A fast-paced co-op roguelite shooter where you rip through alien worlds, harvest mutant body parts, and steal their powers to become the best version of yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE CORPORATE SLAUGHTERHOUSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the newest employee at  <strong>Rangus Meats</strong>, a multi-galactic food conglomerate on a never-ending hunt for the perfect protein. Your mission? Drop onto hostile planets, harvest the locals, swap out your squishy parts, and survive long enough to file your expense report.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every kill, steal new body parts\u2014legs, torsos, or heads\u2014and assimilate their abilities in real time to unlock wild new powers and unstoppable combinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're solo or teamed up with coworkers (uh, \u201cfriends\u201d), you'll face brutal alien bosses, team-based challenges, and a meat grinder of strategic decisions that only get weirder with each planet you conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/ecc020ae50e5e55814c27c5e8afac531.poster.avif?t=1752876180\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/ecc020ae50e5e55814c27c5e8afac531.webm?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/ecc020ae50e5e55814c27c5e8afac531.mp4?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap on the Fly</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip off appendages from fallen enemies and attach them to yourself mid-combat. Legs that triple-jump? A torso that drops turrets? A new brain? Why not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, Fluid Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like <i>Risk of Rain 2</i> and <i>Helldivers 2</i>, SWAPMEAT brings slick movement, explosive firefights, and chaos you can control\u2014if you\u2019re fast enough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Co-Op (1\u20134 Players)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with your taste buds and coordinate builds to survive. Shared upgrades, tactical synergy, and plentiful combo opportunities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run drops you onto planets teeming with unique enemies, random events, and ever-evolving threats. No game is the same, and your build is always mutating.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Alien Worlds</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From meat-moons to fungal biotech cities, explore bizarre planets loaded with lore, loot, and the occasional sentient spleen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Between Runs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape with your parts intact and you\u2019ll earn permanent upgrades for weapons, abilities... and yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/2cab48fe66092986feaf1be48358ade9.poster.avif?t=1752876180\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/2cab48fe66092986feaf1be48358ade9.webm?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/2cab48fe66092986feaf1be48358ade9.mp4?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist today\u2014before your meat gets taken by someone else.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/fb413a0b5089bbd3472badd1857813a0.poster.avif?t=1752876180\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/fb413a0b5089bbd3472badd1857813a0.webm?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/fb413a0b5089bbd3472badd1857813a0.mp4?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEAL LIMBS. SWAP POWERS. BREAK THE GALAXY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to SWAPMEAT: A fast-paced co-op roguelite shooter where you rip through alien worlds, harvest mutant body parts, and steal their powers to become the best version of yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE CORPORATE SLAUGHTERHOUSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the newest employee at  <strong>Rangus Meats</strong>, a multi-galactic food conglomerate on a never-ending hunt for the perfect protein. Your mission? Drop onto hostile planets, harvest the locals, swap out your squishy parts, and survive long enough to file your expense report.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every kill, steal new body parts\u2014legs, torsos, or heads\u2014and assimilate their abilities in real time to unlock wild new powers and unstoppable combinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're solo or teamed up with coworkers (uh, \u201cfriends\u201d), you'll face brutal alien bosses, team-based challenges, and a meat grinder of strategic decisions that only get weirder with each planet you conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/ecc020ae50e5e55814c27c5e8afac531.poster.avif?t=1752876180\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/ecc020ae50e5e55814c27c5e8afac531.webm?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/ecc020ae50e5e55814c27c5e8afac531.mp4?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap on the Fly</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip off appendages from fallen enemies and attach them to yourself mid-combat. Legs that triple-jump? A torso that drops turrets? A new brain? Why not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, Fluid Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like <i>Risk of Rain 2</i> and <i>Helldivers 2</i>, SWAPMEAT brings slick movement, explosive firefights, and chaos you can control\u2014if you\u2019re fast enough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Co-Op (1\u20134 Players)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up with your taste buds and coordinate builds to survive. Shared upgrades, tactical synergy, and plentiful combo opportunities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run drops you onto planets teeming with unique enemies, random events, and ever-evolving threats. No game is the same, and your build is always mutating.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Alien Worlds</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From meat-moons to fungal biotech cities, explore bizarre planets loaded with lore, loot, and the occasional sentient spleen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Between Runs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape with your parts intact and you\u2019ll earn permanent upgrades for weapons, abilities... and yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/2cab48fe66092986feaf1be48358ade9.poster.avif?t=1752876180\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/2cab48fe66092986feaf1be48358ade9.webm?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/2cab48fe66092986feaf1be48358ade9.mp4?t=1752876180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist today\u2014before your meat gets taken by someone else.</p>",
